
  Kiosk admin console
  -------------------
  kiosk back         return to the kiosk screen
  kiosk end-session  wipe the current session and return
  kiosk update       pull the latest kiosk files and apply them
  kiosk status       show the kiosk services
  kiosk check        show versions and settings for troubleshooting
  nmtui              network and Wi-Fi settings (text menus)

  This shell logs out after 10 idle minutes.

